  helperSign: {fileID: 1993873475}
  tutorialText:
  - Hey, I'm helper sign! The wooden sign to your right.
  - Hold Left click anywhere to move. Right click to interact with things. Use the
    scrollwheel to switch inventories.
  - Let's start simple. Take the plastic bags to the trash bin.
  - Once you do so a timer will start. Clean up the classroom before it runs out!
  - Make sure you put all 3 types of rubbish in the right bin. I'll give you feedback
    as to whether you got it right!
  - P.S Every time you deposit an item your speed will increase! So visit the bins
    often.
  dangerText:
